# The Kaini/Bocuma voice — corrected to the community's actual
# SH-01A panel reading, which is humbler than every guess:
#   SAW ONLY, full level. No pulse, no sub, no noise.
# The identity is the ENVELOPE and FILTER, not the mix:
#   - one fast-attack / LONG-decay / near-zero-sustain contour
#     shaping both loudness and cutoff (the 101 shares one ADSR):
#     every note is a bloom that fades, never a held organ tone
#   - strong key tracking (KYBD ~8/10) on the OTA-cascade filter
#     (circuit 1 — the IR3109's family), moderate-low resonance
#   - light triangle vibrato, and AUTO portamento at almost minimum
#     time: the fast linear legato glide
# Wow, tape, and room live in the song / preset bus lines below.
# Bus tuned by measurement against the reference recording's sound
# (not its notes): a steep roll-off above 1 kHz and a worn tape's hiss
# floor (low cutoff, light key tracking, tape_age 0.9); harmonics
# smeared by chorus II, spring and a long room; ~6 cents of wow; and
# a narrow image (width 0.45), since the smear is not wide.
waveform 2
mix_saw 0
mix_pulse 0
mix_tri 0
mix_sine 0
osc2_wave 2
osc2_pitch 0
osc2_level 0
osc3_wave 2
osc3_pitch 0
osc3_level 0
detune 0
sub 0
circuit 1
key_track 0.3
osc_fm 0
sync 0
ring 0
glide 0.012
pulse_width 0.5
attack 0.008
decay 2.2
sustain 0.1
release 0.8
filter_env 1.5
filter_attack 0.005
filter_decay 2.2
filter_sustain 0.1
filter_release 0.8
cutoff 500
resonance 2.0
drive 0.4
saturation 0.4
hpf 16
volume 1.0
octave 3
noise 0.1
fuzz 0
spring 0.2
reverb_decay 0.9
reverb_wet 0.3
chorus_mode 2
chorus_rate 0.5
chorus_depth 0.6
lfo_rate 1.2
lfo_shape 0.5
lfo_pitch 3
lfo_filter 0.06
lfo_pwm 0
tape_wow 0.42
tape_flutter 0.06
tape_drive 0.3
tape_age 0.9
width 0.45
